Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Settings > Privacy & security > Searching Windows
;   Find my files:                      Classic (libraries and desktop only,
;                                       not the whole PC)
;   Respect power settings when indexing: Off
; Indexed locations follow the libraries (Desktop, Documents, Downloads,
; Music, Pictures, Videos), wherever those folders are. Custom locations are
; stored with machine-specific volume IDs, so they are not set here.
; Needs admin rights (HKLM). Takes effect after restarting the
; "Windows Search" service or Windows.
; Undo: "EnableFindMyFiles"=dword:00000001 (Enhanced), "RespectPowerModes"=dword:00000001.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows Search\Gather\Windows\SystemIndex]
"EnableFindMyFiles"=dword:00000000
"RespectPowerModes"=dword:00000000
